      "cells": [
        {
          "type": "notebook_cells",
          "attributes": {
            "definition": {
              "type": "markdown",
              "text": "# Voyager — Incident Postmortem\n\n**Copy this notebook before filling it in.** Editing the template loses it for the next incident.\n\nThe first thing to do after copying is set the notebook's global time range to the incident window. Every graph below inherits it, so the whole document becomes fixed to the period under discussion rather than to whenever someone happens to open it.\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| **Incident** | |\n| **Severity** | |\n| **Declared by / at** | |\n| **Resolved at** | |\n| **Duration of customer impact** | |\n| **Authors** | |\n| **Status** | Draft / In review / Final |\n\n---\n\n## Summary\n\nThree or four sentences, written for someone who was not involved. What broke, who noticed, what the guests experienced, how long it lasted, and what fixed it. If a reader has to scroll to understand what happened, the summary is not finished.\n\n## Customer impact\n\nNumbers, not adjectives. Bookings not completed, revenue not taken, guests who saw an error, confirmation emails not sent. The graphs in the next section are here to be read off, and \"the checkout was degraded\" is not an impact statement.\n\n## What happened\n\n---"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "notebook_cells",
          "attributes": {
            "definition": {
              "type": "markdown",
              "text": "## 1. Business impact\n\nStart here, and quote these numbers in the impact section above. Everything else in this document is in service of explaining this graph."
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "notebook_cells",
          "attributes": {
            "graph_size": "l",
            "split_by": { "keys": [], "tags": [] },
            "definition": {
              "type": "timeseries",
              "title": "Bookings per minute — created, confirmed, failed",
              "show_legend": true,
              "legend_layout": "auto",
              "legend_columns": ["avg", "max", "value"],
              "yaxis": { "include_zero": true },
              "requests": [
                {
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "response_format": "timeseries",
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "created",
                      "query": "sum:voyager.booking.created{env:demo}.as_rate()"
                    },
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "confirmed",
                      "query": "sum:voyager.booking.confirmed{env:demo}.as_rate()"
                    },
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "failed",
                      "query": "sum:voyager.booking.failed{env:demo}.as_rate()"
                    }
                  ],
                  "formulas": [
                    { "formula": "created * 60", "alias": "Created/min" },
                    { "formula": "confirmed * 60", "alias": "Confirmed/min" },
                    { "formula": "failed * 60", "alias": "Failed/min" }
                  ],
                  "style": { "palette": "dog_classic", "line_type": "solid", "line_width": "normal" }
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "notebook_cells",
