              "text": "## 4. Was it us, or was it upstream?\n\nThis is the question that decides whether the action items are engineering work or vendor management. Partial results deserve particular attention: they are a *correct, degraded* answer, they return HTTP 200, and they appear in no error-rate graph anywhere. A search that quietly stopped covering one provider is invisible unless you look here."
