            "definition": {
              "type": "markdown",
              "text": "## 6. What the logs said\n\nFilter to the incident window and the service you suspect. The `chaos.active_flags` facet from 05-FUNCTIONALITY.md § 12.1 is the first thing to check on any Voyager incident: if it is non-empty, someone was running a scenario, and the postmortem is about a demo rather than a fault. Say so explicitly in the summary if that is the case — a postmortem that quietly turns out to have been a rehearsal wastes everyone's second reading."
            }
